ADC Plugin for FAR 1.47
-----------------------
This program is a plugin intended to work
with FAR version 1.52 or higher. Plugin
implements virtual file system based on ADC
database files. Plugin has following
features: lighting fast (up to ten times
faster than ADC itself!) database processing;
option to treat archives as ordinary
folders; ability to view your databases
from remote computer without ADC installed
on that computer (for example via network);
support for ADC categories and descriptions,
all the virtual file system functionality
provided by FAR (file find, save path
shortcut, etc).
